{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"_kritt_extractor_helper\": true,\n  \"stub\": false,\n  \"stub_explanation\": \"\",\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"flow_summary\": \"A nested invocation while the same raffle's reentrancy guard is active is rejected before the release body executes.\",\n      \"flow_trace\": [\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:395 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Accepts an argument-free external invocation and applies nonReentrant.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:69 nonReentrant - Calls _nonReentrantBefore before executing the handler.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:94 _nonReentrantBefore - Checks whether the guard is already entered.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:90 _nonReentrantBeforeView - Reverts with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall when another guarded call on this raffle is active.\"\n      ],\n      \"flow_terminal_action\": \"Revert the nested invocation with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall. If invoked through a prize-token callback, the external token may catch this failure or propagate it to the outer release.\",\n      \"flow_file_path\": \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol\",\n      \"flow_line\": 90,\n      \"flow_input_to_sink\": \"The external actor controls invocation timing, including attempting a nested call. The stored guard state determines rejection; no ABI arguments or caller-selected destination reach the body.\",\n      \"flow_security_relevance\": \"Defines the shared reentrancy boundary protecting the claim mutation and external prize transfer, including callbacks attempted during transferFrom.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"flow_summary\": \"An invocation outside CashWon or Refunding is rejected without contacting the prize contract.\",\n      \"flow_trace\": [\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:395 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Dispatches the argument-free external call without a caller-role check.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:94 _nonReentrantBefore - Requires an unentered guard and marks it entered.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:396 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Reads the stored raffle status.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:397 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Rejects AwaitingPrize, Active, Drawing, and NftWon.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:398 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Reverts with SponsorPrizeUnavailable(currentStatus).\"\n      ],\n      \"flow_terminal_action\": \"Revert with SponsorPrizeUnavailable(currentStatus); the guard write is rolled back and no prize transfer occurs.\",\n      \"flow_file_path\": \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\n      \"flow_line\": 398,\n      \"flow_input_to_sink\": \"Invocation timing determines which existing lifecycle state is observed. The caller cannot supply or override currentStatus.\",\n      \"flow_security_relevance\": \"This lifecycle gate separates sponsor recovery from active escrow and the NFT-winner outcome. It executes before the already-claimed check.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"flow_summary\": \"An invocation in CashWon or Refunding after the prize has already been claimed is rejected.\",\n      \"flow_trace\": [\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:395 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Receives the external call.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:94 _nonReentrantBefore - Acquires the raffle's reentrancy guard.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:397 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Accepts CashWon or Refunding.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:400 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Reads prizeClaimed and reverts with PrizeAlreadyClaimed when true.\"\n      ],\n      \"flow_terminal_action\": \"Revert with PrizeAlreadyClaimed before any external token call.\",\n      \"flow_file_path\": \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\n      \"flow_line\": 400,\n      \"flow_input_to_sink\": \"The caller controls when to repeat the invocation. A previously persisted claim flag determines rejection; the caller cannot reset it through this entrypoint.\",\n      \"flow_security_relevance\": \"Enforces single-use sponsor prize release after a successful claim.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"flow_summary\": \"In CashWon, an unclaimed prize is released to the stored sponsor recipient when transferFrom completes and ownerOf reports that recipient.\",\n      \"flow_trace\": [\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:395 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Accepts an argument-free call from any account or contract.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:94 _nonReentrantBefore - Acquires the reentrancy guard.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:397 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Accepts CashWon; no settlement or winner-redemption prerequisite is checked.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:400 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Requires prizeClaimed to be false.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:402 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Loads sponsorRecipient from configuration established once by initialize.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:403 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Sets prizeClaimed to true before transferring control externally.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:404 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Calls the configured prizeToken.transferFrom(address(this), recipient, prizeTokenId), using the clone as the source.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:405 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Statically calls prizeToken.ownerOf(prizeTokenId) and accepts a decoded owner equal to recipient.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:406 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Emits SponsorPrizeReleased with msg.sender, recipient, prize token, and token ID.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:102 _nonReentrantAfter - Clears the guard and permits normal completion.\"\n      ],\n      \"flow_terminal_action\": \"Persist prizeClaimed=true and the completed external transfer, emit SponsorPrizeReleased, and return without a value.\",\n      \"flow_file_path\": \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\n      \"flow_line\": 404,\n      \"flow_input_to_sink\": \"Invocation timing triggers release after the cash outcome. Token, token ID, and recipient come from stored initialization data, not call arguments. The caller's address is recorded in the event and does not determine the transfer destination.\",\n      \"flow_security_relevance\": \"Moves the escrowed prize through a configurable external contract and relies on that contract's ownership response for delivery verification. transferFrom requires no recipient receiver callback. Release proceeds independently of cash settlement and leaves quote liabilities unchanged.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"flow_summary\": \"In Refunding, an unclaimed prize is released to the stored sponsor recipient without waiting for ticket refunds to finish.\",\n      \"flow_trace\": [\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:395 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Accepts an argument-free permissionless invocation.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:94 _nonReentrantBefore - Acquires the reentrancy guard.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:397 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Accepts Refunding without checking outstanding refund liabilities.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:400 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Requires the prize to remain unclaimed.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:402 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Loads the fixed sponsorRecipient.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:403 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Marks the prize claimed before the external call.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:404 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Calls the configured prize contract's transferFrom with the clone, stored recipient, and stored prizeTokenId.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:405 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Statically queries ownerOf and requires its decoded response to equal recipient.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:406 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Emits SponsorPrizeReleased.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:102 _nonReentrantAfter - Clears the guard and completes the call.\"\n      ],\n      \"flow_terminal_action\": \"Persist the prize claim and completed transfer, emit SponsorPrizeReleased, and return while the raffle remains in Refunding.\",\n      \"flow_file_path\": \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\",\n      \"flow_line\": 404,\n      \"flow_input_to_sink\": \"The caller chooses when to invoke after refunds have been enabled. The call supplies no destination or asset identifier; all transfer arguments come from clone storage.\",\n      \"flow_security_relevance\": \"Authorizes prize recovery independently of ticket refunds. Delivery crosses the external prize-contract boundary and is accepted based on ownerOf; no mandatory receiver callback or asynchronous continuation occurs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"flow_summary\": \"An eligible release fails when the configured prize contract's transferFrom call fails.\",\n      \"flow_trace\": [\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:395 Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize - Receives the permissionless invocation.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol:94 _nonReentrantBefore - Acquires the reentrancy guard.\",\n        \"packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:397 Raf